    "body": "## Summary\nAdd Claude Code marketplace and plugin configuration files for the nostr-skills project.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` with marketplace metadata and plugin listings\n- Added individual `plugin.json` files for both nostr and nak skills\n- Properly structured files for Claude Code plugin discovery and registration\n\n## Plugin Details\n- **nostr**: Knowledge about the Nostr protocol (v0.1.0)\n- **nak**: Nostr Army Knife CLI tool interaction (v0.1.0)",
